OL,3,GNEWSACould you run 90k? Ordinary people
OL,4,Aattempt an extraordinary challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's a bit of a gruelling challenge
OL,7,Fanyway, never mind that it has to be
OL,8,Fdone in 24 hours!"
OL,10,FThat is the summary Gail Martin gives
OL,11,Fwhen asked what she, husband Stuart and
OL,12,Ffriend Andy Kennedy, have let
OL,13,Fthemselves in for as they prepare to
OL,14,Ftake on one of Northern Ireland's
OL,15,Fultimate mountain running challenges.
OL,17,FThe 90km Denis Rankin Round (DRR) in
OL,18,Fthe Mournes takes place on Saturday,
OL,19,Fwith competitors challenged to complete
OL,20,Fthe route within 24 hours.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
