OL,3,GNEWSACould you run 90k? Ordinary people
OL,4,Aattempt an extraordinary challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FGail is hoping that the "buzz and
OL,7,Fadrenaline" will maintain the group's
OL,8,Fenergy levels but she's confident that
OL,9,Fwhen fatigue sets in, running together
OL,10,Fwill help them along.
